10 REM Promise 失败时保留 THROW 的原始错误类型，在同步边界捕获。
20 ASYNC SUB fail() AS VOID
30 THROW NEW ERR_SAMPLE, "task failed"
40 .ENDSUB
50 SUB wait_for_task() AS VOID
60 SYNC fail()
70 .ENDSUB
80 SUB main AS PUBLIC AS VOID
90 DIM trap AS ERROR AS VAR
100 TRY CALL wait_for_task() TRACEBACK ERROR AS trap
110 CATCH ERR_SAMPLE AS caught
120 PRINT F"caught={caught}"
130 .ENDTRY
140 .ENDSUB
150 CALL main
160 END
